          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g032-turn-1",
          "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
          "text": "Every time I open the cart's freezer to serve someone, the display jumps. I'm trying to find out whether what's inside warms up as much as the air does.",
          "sha": "7dc43edb10e19c935f185330052a054e57de39950c37f666729d062a0d0d73e0",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            6216,
            37865
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            230400,
            738000
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g032-turn-2",
          "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
          "text": "The display measures air by the lid. For the trial, I put a second probe inside a sealed bottle of test liquid on the bottom shelf. What did it show?",
          "sha": "f10ad18840b7045cb2cbf9893492d98fb6a9ef2a521a440c64d94185ec606d18",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            7113,
            14979
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            738000,
            1173000
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g032-turn-3",
          "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
          "text": "The air warmed every time I opened the lid, then cooled quickly. The liquid barely changed. But during our last rush, the air didn't cool all the way back before I opened the lid again.",
          "sha": "0c10ec24b3d3d94d2a539d8ac3bbc4c48afe1031e9337c39eb3b6177be78e1c6",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            6451,
            37737
          ],
          "role": "dialogueTurn",
          "range48k": [
            1173000,
            1812000
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "t05-g032-turn-4",
          "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
          "text": "Next run, let's keep the same number of openings but leave more time between them. Then we can see whether the slower pace helps the air get back to where it started.",
          "sha": "03776a65cf393610e7a6827b5d4c196deebe61ed276dcdb3e581dab4f262d0e2",
          "onsetTail48k": [
            7320,
